#. 確かに、矢だけだと細過ぎる…
#. だから、犯人は<CLT 3>もう１つの凶器<CLT>を使ったんだ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're right. Just the one arrow would've been too\n"
"weak. That's why the killer used <CLT 3>another weapon<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. もう１つの凶器…？
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Another weapon...?"
msgstr ""

#. 武道場のロッカーの中には、
#. 丸められた<CLT 3>ガムテープ<CLT>もあったんだ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Inside the dojo locker, we also found a balled-up wad\n"
"of <CLT 3>duct tape<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、犯人はこのガムテープを使って、
#. ジュラルミン製の矢を<CLT 3>束ねた<CLT>んだよ。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The killer probably used this duct tape to <CLT 3>bind<CLT>\n"
"multiple arrows together."
msgstr ""

#. 矢をガムテープで束ねる事によって、
#. <CLT 3>“鉄パイプ程度の太さの凶器”<CLT>を作り上げ…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Bundling them together using the duct tape would\n"
"easily create a <CLT 3>single weapon as thick as a pipe<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それを凶器として使ったんだ！
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And that's exactly what the killer did!"
msgstr ""

#. ３本の矢の教えと…同じね…
#. 戦国武将である毛利元就が…息子達に説いた教え…
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's similar to Aesop's fable about the bundle of\n"
"sticks..."
msgstr ""

#. １本ではもろい矢も…束になれば頑丈になる…
#. そ、そうやって…３兄弟に結束を訴えかけたのよ…
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"One stick is weak, but put them together, and they\n"
"become strong. It's meant to teach cooperation."
msgstr ""

#. 残酷な話だべ…
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Damn, that's harsh..."
msgstr ""

#. どこがよ…聞いてないでしょ…
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "How is it harsh? Were you even listening?"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、これで凶器もわかったはずだ…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Anyway, that explains the murder weapon."
msgstr ""

#. そして、それらの凶器を
#. 武道場のロッカーに隠した犯人こそが…
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"As for who the culprit is that stashed the weapon in\n"
"the dojo locker..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切響子、お前なんだ…！
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It was you, Kyoko!"
msgstr ""

#. …私は武道場なんかに行ってないわよ。
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...I've never been to the dojo."
msgstr ""

#. いや、お前は間違いなく武道場に行っている。
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Oh no, you absolutely have."
msgstr ""

#. …どうして言い切れるの？
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "How can you say that with such confidence?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、証拠があるからだ。
#. そうだよな、苗木？
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Because we have proof, of course. Don't we, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それは……
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Oh, um..."
msgstr "Ồ, ờm..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …ん？　どうした？
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hm? What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

#. まさか、犯人をかばうつもりじゃないだろうな…
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Surely you don't intend to protect a murderer..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事をしてどうなるか…
#. わかってるのか？
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You know what will happen if you do, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. もし、お前がかばった人物が犯人だったら、
#. その先に待っている結末は…
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you cover for the culprit, there's only one thing\n"
"that can lead to..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺達の全員の死…なんだぞ？
msgctxt "0024 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "The death of us all. Remember?"
msgstr ""

#. も、もちろん…わかってるよ…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Of course I remember...!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、お前の手で示してやれ。
#. 霧切が武道場に行った証拠をな…！
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then show us! Show everyone the evidence that proves\n"
"Kyoko went to the dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0027 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ほう…
#. やはり、犯人をかばうつもりなのか…？
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So. You *do* intend to protect a murderer?"
msgstr ""

#. どういう事だべ、苗木っち！
msgctxt "0029 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What's he talking about, Makoto!?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだよ、私たち全員が
#. 処刑されちゃうんだよ？
msgctxt "0030 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah! Tell us, or we're all dead, remember!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 犯人をかばう気なのか…
#. それとも本気でわからないのか…
msgctxt "0032 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Are you trying to protect the culprit, or do you\n"
"honestly not know?"
msgstr ""

#. どちらにせよ、お前の愚鈍さには呆れるな…
msgctxt "0033 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Either way, I'm positively amazed by your stupidity."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ボクが…霧切さんに…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have evidence...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが<CLT><CLT 3>武道場に行ってる証拠<CLT><CLT 4>って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Evidence that <CLT><CLT 3>Kyoko went to the dojo<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが…霧切さんに…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have evidence...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが<CLT><CLT 3>武道場に行ってる証拠<CLT><CLT 4>って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Evidence that <CLT><CLT 3>Kyoko went to the dojo<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>武道場のロッカー<CLT><CLT 4>に関係している、
#. 例の物だよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must be connected to that <CLT><CLT 3>dojo locker<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんが武道場に行った証拠は…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The one thing that proves Kyoko was in the dojo is..."
msgstr ""

#. この…武道場の<CLT 3>ロッカーの鍵<CLT>だよ…
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...right here. The <CLT 3>key to the dojo locker<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …そんな物が、どうして証拠になるの？
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And how does that prove anything?"
msgstr ""

#. これが…霧切さんの部屋に落ちてたからだよ…
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Because...I found it in your room."
msgstr ""

#. 私の部屋に…落ちていた…？
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It was...in my room?"
msgstr ""

#. とぼけても無駄だ…
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Don't bother trying to play dumb."
msgstr ""

#. それに、この鍵だけじゃない…
msgctxt "0046 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That key is just the final piece of the puzzle."
msgstr ""

#. アリバイの件も、動機の件も、
#. 苗木に罪をなすり付ける為の偽装工作の件も…
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Your non-existent alibi, your clear motive, your\n"
"attempts to frame Makoto for the crime..."
msgstr ""

#. それらのすべてが、お前が犯人だと示している。
#. 諦めろ、言い逃れは出来んぞ。
msgctxt "0048 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"This all proves that you are the true culprit. You\n"
"can't explain this away, so just give up."
msgstr ""

#. …ちょっと待って。
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Hold on a second."
msgstr "...Chờ một chút."

#. またか…
#. お前は、どうしても霧切をかばいたいらしいな？
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Not this again. You really are dead-set on defending\n"
"her, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…かばうとかそういう事じゃなくて…
#. ボクはただ…
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No...it's not that I want to defend her. It's just..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんに聞かなくちゃいけない事が、
#. まだ残っているんだよ…
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There's one more thing I need to ask her."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0053 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …霧切さん、教えて欲しいんだ。
#. 昨日の夜の件だよ…
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko, I want you to tell me something."
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の夜、霧切さんはボクの部屋にいたよね…？
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Last night...you were in my room, weren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. あの時、何があったの？
#. どうして、ボクの部屋にいたの？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why? What were you doing there?"
msgstr ""

#. それを…教えて欲しいんだ…
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's what I need to know."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 私は…あなたを助けただけよ…
msgctxt "0059 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I was just...protecting you."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cái gì...?"

#. <CLT 4>ボクを助けた…だけ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She was protecting me...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、もしかして霧切さんは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then does that mean she...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが襲われた事に気が付いて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She knew I was being attacked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それで、助けに来てくれて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and she came to my rescue.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、その時に…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could that be when...!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もし、そうだとしたら、
#. 霧切さんは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean that Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクのせいで…殺人を…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She killed someone...for me...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. もういいだろう。無駄話は終わりだ。
#. そろそろ結論を出すぞ…
msgctxt "0068 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's enough. The time for idle chatter is over. A\n"
"verdict is close at hand..."
msgstr ""

#. …ちょっと待って。
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Wait."
msgstr "Đợi đã."

#. 間違わないで…私は犯人じゃない…
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I'm warning you, don't make this mistake. I'm not the\n"
"killer."
msgstr ""

#. まさか…お前の往生際がそこまで悪いとはな…
msgctxt "0071 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I knew you were stubborn, but this is just getting\n"
"ridiculous."
msgstr ""

#. …だけど、私が犯人じゃないって事は、
#. あなたが１番よく知っているはずよ？
msgctxt "0072 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Really? But you should know better than anyone I\n"
"didn't do it."
msgstr ""

#. そうでしょう、十神君…？
msgctxt "0073 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Can you tell me I'm wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺が…だと？
msgctxt "0074 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I...should know?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Cái gì...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが犯人じゃない事は、
#. 十神クンが１番よく知っているはず…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya should know better than anyone...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって…どういう意味だ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What does that mean?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
